     <p style=";text-align: center;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">关于举行第</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">次学生代表大会暨第</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">届团学联主席团选举的通知</span></span></strong></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"> </span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">全校各班：</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"> </span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴一中第二十</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">六</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">次学生代表大会暨第二十</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">六</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">届团学联主席团选举大会即将举行，大会将民主选举产生新一届团学联主席团成员。</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">
</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">大会时间</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">：</span><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体;">9月</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">25</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体;">日（周</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体;">四</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体;">）</span></strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">12:30-13:</span>35</span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">大会地点</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：养新书藏图书馆二号报告厅（三楼）</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">入场时间</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">：</span><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体;">12:15-12:25</span></strong></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">着装要求</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">与会代表</span></span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">及</span></span><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">工作人员</span></span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">请规范穿着校服，佩戴校徽；</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">主席团候选人</span></span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">及</span></span><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">大会主席团成员</span></span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">请规范穿着</span></span><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">正装</span></span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校服（上身长袖衬衫</span><span style="font-family:宋体">+领花/领带，下身</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">黑色</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">长裤</span><span style="font-family:宋体">/格子裙），佩戴校徽，团员请同时佩戴团徽。</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">请</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">全体学生代表</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">及</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">即将离任的团学联主要干部</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（第二十</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">五</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">届主席团、社团联主席团、部长副部长）携带</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2B铅笔</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">于</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12:15-12:25抵达会场，签到并按现场座位表有序入座，遵守大会纪律，认真参与大会各项议程，审慎行使投票权利；</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">请勿携带与大会无关的物品入场</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。各班出席情况将计入期末班级团支部考核。</span></span></p><p style=";font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 32px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
